      "writtenOn": "2024-07-24T20:14:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this fData used for anything besides immutable samplers? It is very non-obvious in this code that someone should be checking this value to know if there are immutable samplers in the data.\n\nI think either this name should be changed to something like fImmutableSamplerData or if fData is meant to be generic, we need some mechanism to verify that the values stored in are meant for immutable samplers in this case",
